<title>USA: Louisana PFA Hospital repriced, top yield cut.</title>
<headline>Louisana PFA Hospital repriced, top yield cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc. said</p>
<p>Thursday it repriced Louisana Public Faclities Authority</p>
<p>Hospital $29 million bond deal by cutting the top yield to</p>
<p>5.771 percent from 5.781.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
